>,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">find</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Objetos</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">: Sintaxis de objeto literal, propiedades y m&eacute;todos.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Acceso, modificaci&oacute;n y eliminaci&oacute;n de propiedades.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Iteraci&oacute;n sobre objetos (</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">for...in</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">Object.keys</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">Object.values</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">).</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Bloque 2: Programaci&oacute;n Orientada a Objetos. M&oacute;dulos. Fechas. Expresiones Regulares.</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">2.1. Programaci&oacute;n Orientada a Objetos (POO) en JavaScript</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">El modelo de prototipos (introducci&oacute;n conceptual).</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Clases en ES6:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-s