\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">El objeto&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">Date</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">: creaci&oacute;n y manipulaci&oacute;n de fechas y horas.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">M&eacute;todos&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">get</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;y&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">set</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;para obtener y establecer componentes de una fecha.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">2.4. Expresiones Regulares</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Sintaxis b&aacute;sica y creaci&oacute;n de patrones (</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">RegExp</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">).</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Uso con m&eacute;todos de&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">String</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">match</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">search</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">replace</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Validaci&oacute;n de formularios como caso de uso principal.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Bloque 3: BOM y DOM. Gesti&oacute;n de eventos.</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">3.1. El Browser Object Model (BOM)</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">El objeto&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">window</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">: &aacute;mbito global en el navegador.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Objetos clave:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">navigator</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">location</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">history</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Temporizadores:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;y&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">setInterval</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">3.2. El Document Object Model (DOM)</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Estructura de &aacute;rbol del DOM.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Selecci&oacute;n de elementos:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">querySelector</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;y&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">querySelectorAll</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Manipulaci&oacute;n de elementos del DOM:</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Modificaci&oacute;n de contenido:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">textContent</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">innerHTML</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Modificaci&oacute;n de atributos:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">setAttribute</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">getAttribute</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Gesti&oacute;n de clases CSS:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">classList</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">add</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">remove</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-inserted\">toggle</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">).</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\r\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Modificaci&oacute;n de estilos en l&iacute;nea:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"inline-code ng-star-